    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-10" id="fn-10" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:61.513%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:98.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="display:none"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Account 223 &#8220;Advances from associated companies&#8221; had balances of zero and $45.2 million as of December 31, 2023 and 2022, respectively. In January 2022, we entered into a long-term promissory note with the Partnership for a revolving line of credit which amended our previous note to increase our maximum principal amount to $200 million from $100 million and extended the term of the note to December 31, 2027. In March 2023, we repaid the long-term promissory note with the Partnership in full. The annual interest rate charged on the long-term debt payable to the Partnership was 5.50% for the three months ended March 31, 2023, and 5.48% for the year ended December 31, 2022. Total interest paid to the Partnership was $0.6 million and $2.8 million for the years ended December 31, 2023 and 2022, respectively.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
